    <Major>AFK Farming for Digjmon Masters Online/Digimon Masters World</Major>
    <Description>This is the best and fastest way for you to farm if you already have a Magnetic ID! 

You will need a strong Digimon, because we will only be focusing on one-shotting as many as possible. I would highly recommend going to Shinjuku West (Night) and using this either on the schoolyard, or the Elementary Courts. You can farm components and Old Headsets in order to sell them off for high amounts of tera! 100+ old headsets easily yields over a tera and you will also be collecting eggs and other items in the process easily sellable at a vending machine or any other merchant. 

</Description>
